# E2: the EXACTNESS ARM, UNAUDITED: c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic-roundhost (E1's profile plus QWEN_FAST_TP4_ROUND_HOST_SELECT, _READ, _KEYED and _LEAN) on the same image and the same tests as E1, run after it.
# STRICT exactness (the owner's rule): the greedy output of every user of every test is byte-identical to E1's.
# READ: c2_smoke_check clean with its round_host rules (the engaged line names select=1 read=1 keyed=1 lean=1; the ledger on every step; SELECT and READ on 95% of the drafting steps; the keyed write on half of the verifies; no line LEAN drops;
# no 'declined' line) and then, offline: python3 scripts/ci/w2ln_timing_compare.py pair <E1 server log> <E2 server log> --a-smoke <E1 smoke log> --b-smoke <E2 smoke log> (texts equal: every hash of every test) and
# python3 scripts/ci/speed_window_compare.py <E1 results> <E2 results> --users 0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7 --position-keyed --strict-concurrent-prefixes (exit 0: identical accepted prefixes). ANY hash difference, accepted-prefix difference or stall is a NO-GO for the lever set. Duration (estimate): 120 min. Stop rule.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/round-host window (docs/tp4-round-host.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/round-host and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the classes, the minutes, the NEEDS graph and every read rule.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-rh-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/round-host commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-rh-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic-roundhost
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4_steady,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_equal,concurrent8_code_32k,steady_resend,replay_concurrent4,replay_concurrent8,concurrent5_split,concurrent8_drain
